            "description": "After hitting a target, gains EXP if it is defeated within 4s. Upon reaching level , gains Sanctify and increases his level cap to . Sanctify: Increases a teammate's level cap, with a chance to earn EXP. When playing as support, grants additional Sanctification effects.",
